{"5271880":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"IRON SOL","steam_appid":5271880,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5475630],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Knowing is progress<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IRON SOL<\/strong> is a <strong>difficult<\/strong> semi-open world <strong>2D platformer<\/strong> with a focus on gradual exploration, atmosphere, and unusual but fun platforming mechanics. Your abilities are limited only by your own knowledge. The more abilities you know how to use, the more open the world becomes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/extras\/d3ba91f048e032b55fe5d6e6e19eac22.poster.avif?t=1793646010\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/extras\/d3ba91f048e032b55fe5d6e6e19eac22.webm?t=1793646010\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/extras\/d3ba91f048e032b55fe5d6e6e19eac22.mp4?t=1793646010\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A different kind of platformer<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not expect typical platformer mechanics. Your <strong>abilities<\/strong>, <strong>movement<\/strong>, and even <strong>jumping<\/strong>, <strong>feel different<\/strong> than in other games, <strong>learning to move<\/strong> will be a challenge itself. IRON SOL will feel unique both for new and experienced platformer players. It is up to you to master this strange moveset and overcome even the <strong>toughest challenges<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/extras\/d7ca0af157ced6a1561103e03b930904.poster.avif?t=1793646010\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/extras\/d7ca0af157ced6a1561103e03b930904.webm?t=1793646010\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/extras\/d7ca0af157ced6a1561103e03b930904.mp4?t=1793646010\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A ruined world<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 4 <strong>unique areas<\/strong> and find <strong>80 collectibles<\/strong> within difficult trials all across the game, maybe there is even something else hidden... Piece together stories of lives long gone, discover structures and machines of unknown purpose, unravel the history of the world and the reality of your place in it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/extras\/13876fb1231717ebe254d9e762f0c074.poster.avif?t=1793646010\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/extras\/13876fb1231717ebe254d9e762f0c074.webm?t=1793646010\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/extras\/13876fb1231717ebe254d9e762f0c074.mp4?t=1793646010\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Knowing is progress<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IRON SOL<\/strong> is a <strong>difficult<\/strong> semi-open world <strong>2D platformer<\/strong> with a focus on gradual exploration, atmosphere, and unusual but fun platforming mechanics. Your abilities are limited only by your own knowledge. The more abilities you know how to use, the more open the world becomes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/extras\/d3ba91f048e032b55fe5d6e6e19eac22.poster.avif?t=1793646010\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/extras\/d3ba91f048e032b55fe5d6e6e19eac22.webm?t=1793646010\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/extras\/d3ba91f048e032b55fe5d6e6e19eac22.mp4?t=1793646010\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A different kind of platformer<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not expect typical platformer mechanics. Your <strong>abilities<\/strong>, <strong>movement<\/strong>, and even <strong>jumping<\/strong>, <strong>feel different<\/strong> than in other games, <strong>learning to move<\/strong> will be a challenge itself. IRON SOL will feel unique both for new and experienced platformer players. It is up to you to master this strange moveset and overcome even the <strong>toughest challenges<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/extras\/d7ca0af157ced6a1561103e03b930904.poster.avif?t=1793646010\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/extras\/d7ca0af157ced6a1561103e03b930904.webm?t=1793646010\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/extras\/d7ca0af157ced6a1561103e03b930904.mp4?t=1793646010\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A ruined world<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 4 <strong>unique areas<\/strong> and find <strong>80 collectibles<\/strong> within difficult trials all across the game, maybe there is even something else hidden... Piece together stories of lives long gone, discover structures and machines of unknown purpose, unravel the history of the world and the reality of your place in it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/extras\/13876fb1231717ebe254d9e762f0c074.poster.avif?t=1793646010\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/extras\/13876fb1231717ebe254d9e762f0c074.webm?t=1793646010\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/extras\/13876fb1231717ebe254d9e762f0c074.mp4?t=1793646010\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"You do not unlock any abilities - you only learn the truth about what you have always been able to do. Explore a ruined world, overcome unique platforming challenges, collect remnants of your kin, and discover what you are.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/d8b766ee2a779eaa98e0589c01a8fc1246f9ab44\/header.jpg?t=1793646010","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/1cb25cc8aefb47d65cb836d3fad04ae8b3a7e9e3\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793646010","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271880\/1cb25cc8aefb47d65cb836d3fad04ae8b3a7e9e3\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793646010","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br>